   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FWC - Lot 2 -Events and Organise awareness campaigns</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;Organise events and awareness campaigns related to key issues of joint interest in the EU &#xbf; Egypt partnership for targeted audience under the supervision of the EU Delegation, s&lt;/span&gt;uch support will allow strengthening the EU partnership to Egypt and improve the image towards the Egyptian public, the Government of Egypt, EU Members States and other interlocutors.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
